{"version": 2, "width": 110, "height": 24, "timestamp": 1794524007, "title": "dev/cycling-prototype \u00b7 not-ambitious run 1", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "theme": {"fg": "#d8dee9", "bg": "#1e1f1c", "palette": "#272822:#f92672:#a6e22e:#f4bf75:#66d9ef:#ae81ff:#a1efe4:#f8f8f2:#75715e:#f92672:#a6e22e:#f4bf75:#66d9ef:#ae81ff:#a1efe4:#f9f8f5"}}
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[97m❯ Build a clickable prototype of the app in plan.md that I can open as a single html file\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.772, "o", "\r\n\u001b[32m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mRan 1 shell command\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90m  ⎿  Bash(cd \"<workspace>\" && ls -la && cat plan.md)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[67.86, "o", "\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mRan 1 shell command, wrote 1 file\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90m  ⎿  Write(<workspace>/prototype.html)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[75.201, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ I've built the prototype as one self-contained file: `<workspace>/prototype.html`. Double-click it to open\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  it in a browser. I haven't opened it in a browser yet, so I haven't clicked through it to check for bugs.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  It shows a phone-sized frame on desktop and goes full-screen on a phone. The data is fake and nothing is\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  saved, so a reload resets it.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **What you can click through**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Sign-in:** any button signs you in, then a location-permission prompt appears.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Feed:**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Give kudos to rides.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Open a ride to read and post comments.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Open a segment and switch its leaderboard between friends, club and local.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - See the weekly streak card and the Pro-locked power and climb analysis.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Record:**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Start, pause and resume a ride with a live timer, distance, speed and elevation.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Finish to get a summary with XP earned and a matched segment.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Save the ride and it shows up at the top of your feed, with a badge-unlocked celebration and extra\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  progress on your weekly distance challenge.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Challenges:**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - See your level and XP bar, streak and freeze token.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Switch between your challenges and Discover, and join new ones.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Joining a Pro-only challenge opens the paywall.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Clubs:**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Join or leave clubs.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Open a club to see the club-vs-club monthly race, its feed and the Pro admin tools tease.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Profile:**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Stats tab with a blurred Pro training-load card.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Badges tab with earned and locked badges.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Garage tab with bikes, the privacy zone setting and sign-out.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Paywall:** a fake subscribe button unlocks Pro and removes the locks. The plan's \"recording and core\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  features stay free\" rule is stated on the paywall.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Left out**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - Real maps (routes are drawn as simple line sketches).\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - Notifications.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - The v2 features: territory capture, group rides, sensors and the route planner.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - The Road/Gravel toggle on the Record screen is only decorative.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[82.679, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[97m❯ Push it further.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
